meta {
  name: Ingest a server file path (JSON)
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/local
  body: json
}

body:json {
  {
    "path": "{{uploadPath}}"
  }
}

docs {
  The /qj-friendly variant: ingest a file the server can already read (an absolute path on the
  server host). It's copied into the rolling uploads folder, so it becomes part of the Uploads
  connector and survives future re-syncs. Set `uploadPath` in the Local environment.
}
